k":"27:43","t":"And that which she was worshipping other than Allāh had averted her [from submission to Him]. Indeed, she was from a disbelieving people.\"","j":19,"h":38,"s":27,"a":43,"sd":null},{"k":"27:44","t":"She was told, \"Enter the palace.\" But when she saw it, she thought it was a body of water and uncovered her shins [to wade through]. He said, \"Indeed, it is a palace [whose floor is] made smooth with glass.\" She said, \"My Lord, indeed I have wronged myself, and I submit with Solomon to Allāh, Lord of the worlds.\"","j":19,"h":38,"s":27,"a":44,"sd":null}],"juz":19,"hizb":38,"surahs":[27],"sajdah":false}